      "content": { "json": "## Illustrative Provisioned Throughput (PTU) comparison\nThis calculation starts with **illustrative assumptions**, not current Azure prices: 15 PTU, USD 1.00 per PTU-hour, USD 0.25 per one million input tokens, and USD 2.00 per one million output tokens. Replace all four values with current prices for **one comparable model and deployment type** before making a decision. Do not use a blended rate for Model Router or across this lab's chat and embedding deployments.\n\nRates, PTU minimums, reservations, regions, and customer agreements vary; reconcile the result with Azure pricing and Cost Management. Short sampling windows extrapolate aggressively." },
      "name": "hdr-ptu"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          { "id": "p-ptu-count", "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0", "name": "PTU_Count", "label": "PTU reserved (illustrative)", "type": 1, "isRequired": true, "value": "15" },
          { "id": "p-ptu-price", "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0", "name": "PTU_HourlyUSD", "label": "USD per PTU-hour (illustrative)", "type": 1, "isRequired": true, "value": "1.0" },
